{"id":"vod_md_8139","vodId":"8139","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"狼与香辛料","name_cn":"狼与香辛料","date":"2008-01-01","year":"2008","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"13集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20240410-1/e421fb15f549f9418ab656e2e8f24a10.jpg"},"summary":"电视动画《狼与香辛料》改编自日本轻小说家支仓冻砂原作的同名轻小说。\r\n到处旅行靠贩卖一些小商品为生的商人罗伦斯，从因为收获祭而沸腾的帕斯罗村回来后却发现自己的运货马车中貌似有什么东西在里面，罗伦斯把麦束拨开一看，里面却睡着一只长有狼耳和狼尾巴的少女。这位少女自称是“掌控丰收的贤狼——赫萝”，靠麦子为生的她如果遗失了脖子上挂的帕斯罗当地麦子就会死。赫萝死赖着罗伦斯希望他能够带她回到遥远的北方故乡，见到少女的一只手变化成狼脚的罗伦斯，虽然一边怀疑赫萝的身份，但一边也答应让想回到出生的“遥远的北方”的少女一同旅行，于是，狼女与商人“完全没有剑与魔法的”旅行由此展开……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"冒险,奇幻,爱情,经济"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2024-04-10 02:16:55","classic":true,"classicRank":31,"franchise":"狼与香辛料","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20240409/jDZMhtnI/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20240409/YNt19Cig/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20240409/ON1wvLxV/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20240409/ueLWZmhv/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20240409/kXExisNl/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20240409/xr7OzFX0/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20240409/GIz2AEfw/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20240409/yfn40zig/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20240409/EitALwIf/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20240409/HYhHLDEK/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20240409/OlJmFA9t/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20240409/OjHC8Ujm/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20240409/Ao3kuU16/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-21T15:02:05.831Z"}